t<Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.Expr>\n  )\n  | EFnName(\n    Darklang.LanguageTools.ID,\n    Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.NameResolution<\n      Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.FQFnName.FQFnName\n    >,\n    List<Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.FQFnName.BoundImpl>,\n    typeArgs: List<Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.TypeReference>\n  )\n  | ERecordUpdate(\n    Darklang.LanguageTools.ID,\n    record: Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.Expr,\n    updates: List<(String * Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.Expr)>\n  )\n  | EStatement(\n    Darklang.LanguageTools.ID,\n    first: Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.Expr,\n    next: Darklang.LanguageTools.ProgramTypes.Expr\n  )\n  | ESelf(Darklang.LanguageTools.ID)")
        Stdlib.Test.pass()

        // CLEANUP the move to call syntax changed this; it was "same"
